Package: kalinka-plugin-airplay
Version: @VERSION@
Section: python
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: kalinka-server, kalinka-plugin-sdk (>= 3.21), kalinka-plugin-sdk (<< 4), python3 (>= 3.11), avahi-daemon, @SHLIBS_DEPENDS@
Maintainer: Dmitry Savin <envelsavinds@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/Kalinka-Player/kalinka-plugin-airplay
Description: AirPlay receiver input for Kalinka Music Player
 Server-side AirPlay plugin: an iPhone, iPad or Mac plays through Kalinka's
 selected renderer, which pulls the audio from the server as a live PCM
 stream. Bundles shairport-sync 5.5.2 with AirPlay 2 and nqptp 1.2.8, with
 their source. Requires SDK 3.21 and a Core/renderer supporting live PCM v1.
